    hintText: 'confront three distorted facts


      make additional attempts to
      call for help


      recall Claire''s advice'
  - endingNumber: 3
    buttonText: Ending #3
    hintText: listen to Claire's advice and don't forget
  - endingNumber: 4
    buttonText: Ending #4
    hintText: find a way to not face it... at least this time
  - endingNumber: 5
    buttonText: Ending #5
    hintText: end the guest's visit in your house
